<title>USA: Trion Inc Q1 shr nil vs $0.08.</title>
<headline>Trion Inc Q1 shr nil vs $0.08.</headline>
<dateline>SANFORD, N.C. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net shr	   $0.00		    $0.08</p>
<p> Net		 6			  574</p>
<p> Revs		13,572		   16,869</p>
<p> Avg shrs	   6,997		    6,976</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company said its operating income for the first quarter of 1997 was $287,000 versus $1.2 million for the same quarter a year before.</p>
<p>The company said 1996 results were restated for the acquistion of Hermidifier Co Inc, which was done under a pooling of interests.</p>
<p>The company said earnings declined primarily because of lower sales at its Envirco subsidiary, which had a strong first quarter last year.</p>
